	.string "Command DODRIO's three heads to\n"
	.string "catch falling BERRIES.\p"
	.string "Press right, up, or left on the\n"
	.string "{PLUS} Control Pad to move the heads.\p"
	.string "To play this game, you must have\n"
	.string "a DODRIO.$"

